h  speechless right  but one thing is clear after the  test-drive the driver's seat is the best  place to be the concentrated power of  the Bentley could make you forget the  luxury surroundings as with any Bentley  the interior combines high-tech  convenience with old-world charm the GT  sees cabin boasts some of the finest  materials you can find in an automobile  from supple leather to handcrafted rich  veneer it's one of those things you just  have to enjoy and touch
 

